Wrong (C): Distributing web content through a global network describes a content delivery network (CDN), which is unrelated to data warehouse integration.
Wrong (D): Multidimensional analysis using OLAP cubes occurs after the warehouse is populated. OLAP queries data; ETL loads it.$EXPL$
