Wrong (C): A fully normalized third normal form design is used in OLTP systems for transactional integrity, not for analytical data warehouse performance.
Wrong (D): Unrelated flat files provide no relational structure, dimensional modeling, or query optimization for analytical reporting workloads.$EXPL$
