-- Q3517: Data Management and Lifecycle [medium/L2]
-- Issues: #1, #3
UPDATE questions SET
  choices = $EXPL$["The IT director, because IT controls all technical infrastructure and permissions","The data owner (CMO), because data owners authorize all access to their data","The compliance department, because HIPAA regulations govern all access decisions","The contractors'' project manager, because external teams manage their own access"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Per COBIT 2019 APO01.06 and NIST SP 800-18, the data owner is accountable for determining classification levels and authorizing who may access the data asset. The IT director should not have granted access without the CMO''s approval as data owner.
