-- Q3522: Data Management and Lifecycle [hard/L1]
-- Issues: #1, #3
UPDATE questions SET
  choices = $EXPL$["The data warehouse will contain no data from the failed batch load","Reports will use unconverted currencies, non-standard dates, and duplicate records","The source systems will lose their original transactional data permanently","Users will receive an explicit error message when they attempt to access reports"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Per COBIT 2019 DSS06, a silent ETL transform failure loads untransformed data into the warehouse, causing currency mismatches, inconsistent date formats, and duplicate records that inflate financial totals. Reports appear normal while containing materially inaccurate data.
